==============================================================================
2. Is the vineyard braid the square of the trajectory braid?
==============================================================================
  trajectory braid          s1 s2^-1
  its square                s1 s2^-1 s1 s2^-1
  measured vineyard braid   s2^-1 s1 s2^-1 s1

  equal as braids?          False
  conjugate as braids?      yes, by s1
  check the conjugation by hand: s1^-1 (s1 s2^-1 s1 s2^-1) s1
    = s2^-1 s1 s2^-1 s1
  closure is a conjugacy invariant, so the knot follows from this
  alone, with no appeal to SL(2,Z).

